  "prefLabel": "Env-Wt 405.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wt 405.01 Purpose. The purpose of this part is to establish:\n\n(a) The criteria for delineating and classifying jurisdictional areas; and\n\n(b) The criteria for classifying the various kinds of projects that impact jurisdictional areas.\n\nSource. #12804, eff 12-15-19",
